hance of spawning a variety of weapons to help in defeating the snake menace.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Discover the Liliad!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What led to the fall of the Frogean Empire? How can Frogean kind repopulate? Find out in the epic\u00a0<span class=\"bb_strike\">time-waster</span>\u00a0tale detailing the fall and hopeful return of the Frogean Empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Steam Exclusive Features!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller Support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your friends will know you play Frogmageddon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And many more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the frog! Live the frog!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201190/extras/2c549deeb2fd21ee8fab9165f2d978f4.poster.avif?t=1762704763\" width=540 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201190/extras/2c549deeb2fd21ee8fab9165f2d978f4.webm?t=1762704763\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Frog Mage Udon","Sunset Dreamland"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201190/header.jpg?t=1762704763","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3201190/1517633208/d28c4a0c1e828998b017143638edd71183632713/1750880363/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747676028","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3201190/1517633208/d28c4a0c1e828998b017143638edd71183632713/1750880363/dash_h264.mp